                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Feels very unpolished and clunky overall. Controls are ok, but models are very basic, interface is extremely rough, and the gameplay? Good luck trying to aim. Multiplayer is also broken in some ways, and the way the camera locks between rounds is headache-inducing. Nevermind trying to see the scoreboard, because it only partially displays in one eye...\n\nI really like the premise of this and the mixture of historical background with gameplay, but this is something that is pre-alpha and shouldn't be sold yet or cost what it does right now.\n\nTLDR: Neat concepot, but stay away until massive improvements have been made.",
